step	1	2	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Captain Harlan</col> outside the <col=800000>Lumbridge</col> general store offered a bounty on whoever has been causing trouble around town. The goblins are getting the blame. I should speak to <col=800000>Mudfoot</col>, a goblin south of the cow field.</col>
step	2	6	After meeting Mudfoot
line	<str>Captain Harlan outside the Lumbridge general store offered a bounty on whoever has been causing trouble around town. The goblins are getting the blame.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Mudfoot</col> told me some humans dumped their loot on the goblins, and he agreed to come with me to prove it. We should confront the outlaw at the general store.</col>
step	3	10	After the confrontation
line	<str>Captain Harlan outside the Lumbridge general store offered a bounty on whoever has been causing trouble around town. The goblins are getting the blame.</str>
line	<str>Mudfoot told me some humans dumped their loot on the goblins, and he agreed to come with me to prove it.</str>
line	<col=000080>The ranger at the general store shrugged off <col=800000>Mudfoot</col>'s warhammer, and <col=800000>Captain Harlan</col> explained the combat triangle to me. I should hunt down the outlaws, starting with the ranger by the windmill, and pick the right style to beat each one.</col>
step	4	14	After beating the ranger
line	<str>Captain Harlan outside the Lumbridge general store offered a bounty on whoever has been causing trouble around town. The goblins are getting the blame.</str>
line	<str>Mudfoot told me some humans dumped their loot on the goblins, and he agreed to come with me to prove it.</str>
line	<str>The ranger at the general store shrugged off Mudfoot's warhammer, and Captain Harlan explained the combat triangle to me.</str>
line	<col=000080>I beat the ranger by the windmill. Next is the mage near the <col=800000>H.A.M. hideout</col>.</col>
step	5	20	After beating the mage
line	<str>Captain Harlan outside the Lumbridge general store offered a bounty on whoever has been causing trouble around town. The goblins are getting the blame.</str>
line	<str>Mudfoot told me some humans dumped their loot on the goblins, and he agreed to come with me to prove it.</str>
line	<str>The ranger at the general store shrugged off Mudfoot's warhammer, and Captain Harlan explained the combat triangle to me.</str>
line	<str>I beat the ranger by the windmill.</str>
line	<col=000080>I beat the mage near the <col=800000>H.A.M. hideout</col>. The last outlaw is an armoured warrior in the graveyard, who prays against melee.</col>
step	6	26	After beating the warrior
